<view class="admin-map-page"><view class="page-title">小区地图管理</view><view class="description">先核验小区公共中心或入口，再启用展示。订单按小区名称/别名与位置共同匹配；不匹配的订单保留在列表。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="add" wx:if="{{adminSuper || adminPermissions.communityMap_saveAdmin}}">新增公共小区</button><view class="description" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="load" loading="{{loading}}">刷新</button><view class="settings-card" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="_id"><view class="card-title">{{item.name}} · {{item.enabled ? '已启用' : '已停用'}}</view><view class="description">{{item.city}} {{item.district}} · {{item.aliases.length}} 个别名</view><button class="secondary" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="edit" wx:if="{{adminSuper || adminPermissions.communityMap_saveAdmin}}">编辑与纠错</button></view><view class="description" wx:if="{{!loading && !rows.length}}">尚未配置小区。新增后，符合条件的订单和主动公开的宠托师才会出现在地图。</view></view>
<view class="edit-mask" wx:if="{{form}}"><scroll-view scroll-y class="edit-panel"><view class="settings-card"><view class="card-title">{{form.id ? '编辑小区' : '新增小区'}}</view><view class="description">修改公共资料版本后，相关宠托师需重新确认公开，避免未经同意改变展示位置。</view><input class="field" placeholder="规范小区名称" value="{{form.name}}" data-field="name" bindinput="input" maxlength="60" /><input class="field" placeholder="城市，如深圳市" value="{{form.city}}" data-field="city" bindinput="input" maxlength="40" /><input class="field" placeholder="行政区，如南山区" value="{{form.district}}" data-field="district" bindinput="input" maxlength="40" /><textarea class="field aliases" placeholder="小区别名，每行一个；不填写家庭门牌" value="{{form.aliasesText}}" data-field="aliasesText" bindinput="input" maxlength="1600" /><button class="secondary" bindtap="choose">选择公共入口 / 小区中心</button><view class="description">公共坐标：{{form.latitude}}, {{form.longitude}}</view><view class="description">地址匹配最大距离（0.1～3公里，默认1公里）</view><input class="field" type="digit" value="{{form.matchRadiusKm}}" data-field="matchRadiusKm" bindinput="input" /><view class="switch-line"><text>启用地图展示</text><switch checked="{{form.enabled}}" bindchange="toggleEnabled" color="#176b5b" /></view><view class="consent" bindtap="confirm">{{form.confirmPublic ? '☑' : '☐'}} 我已核验：该名称和坐标属于公共小区，不含家庭位置或私人信息</view><button class="primary" bindtap="save" disabled="{{busy || !form.confirmPublic}}" loading="{{busy}}">保存</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="close" disabled="{{busy}}">取消</button></view></scroll-view></view>
